Package: validatoR
Title: Validation of (Genomic) Prediction Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Renzo", "Bonifazi", , "renzo.bonifazi@wur.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1794-4708"))
Description: Tools for validating (genomic) prediction models in animal
    breeding. Includes native support for reading software output files (e.g. MiXBLUP) and utilities for defining validation
    groups.
